WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.384 --> 00:00:16.256
"I have get to Metro City Plumbing Supply," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:16.276 --> 00:00:19.038
"Mr. Copper has disappeared!"

3
00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:23.262
Roxy popped her head into the classroom.

4
00:00:23.282 --> 00:00:25.944
"I'll be back soon, Miss Apricot.

5
00:00:27.045 --> 00:00:29.888
Um, Principal Penn needs help in the library!"

6
00:00:31.904 --> 00:00:32.985
Terrell scratched his head.

7
00:00:33.765 --> 00:00:36.506
"Roxy is always running off somewhere."

8
00:00:38.927 --> 00:00:39.987
Miss Apricot looked up.

9
00:00:40.828 --> 00:00:46.650
"Shh!" Roxy ran down the hall and out the front door.

10
00:00:48.111 --> 00:00:49.131
She shot into the air.

11
00:00:51.212 --> 00:00:55.514
Zoom! Roxy arrived at Metro City Plumbing Supply.

12
00:00:56.654 --> 00:00:58.195
Detective Smith was in an office.

13
00:00:59.075 --> 00:01:00.616
He sat on the edge of the desk.

14
00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.069
A cute little baby snuggled in his arms.

15
00:01:04.089 --> 00:01:07.349
"Hi, Detective," Roxy said.

16
00:01:07.369 --> 00:01:10.530
"Did you get a new job as a babysitter?"

17
00:01:10.550 --> 00:01:14.171
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith frowned.

18
00:01:14.191 --> 00:01:16.952
"I'm not babysitting, Rocket Girl.

19
00:01:17.932 --> 00:01:19.613
Somebody left this—ouch!"

20
00:01:20.553 --> 00:01:22.533
The baby was pulling on the detective's ear.

21
00:01:22.553 --> 00:01:25.274
"Somebody left this baby here."

22
00:01:26.414 --> 00:01:28.335
Roxy looked closely at Detective Smith.

23
00:01:28.355 --> 00:01:32.933
"You look different—younger."

24
00:01:34.454 --> 00:01:35.735
Detective Smith chuckled.

25
00:01:35.755 --> 00:01:37.777
"Thanks for noticing.

26
00:01:38.117 --> 00:01:40.319
I got a new treatment at Vanda's Day Spa.

27
00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:46.184
Vanda said it would take years off my life."

28
00:01:46.945 --> 00:01:48.346
Detective Smith cleared his throat.

29
00:01:48.366 --> 00:01:52.589
"But we have more important things to discuss now, Rocket Girl."

30
00:01:53.971 --> 00:01:54.671
Roxy nodded.

31
00:01:54.691 --> 00:01:57.273
"This baby looks familiar."

32
00:01:58.615 --> 00:01:59.976
The baby smiled and clapped.

33
00:02:02.732 --> 00:02:03.072
"Da-da! Goo!"

34
00:02:03.092 --> 00:02:03.593
Roxy giggled.

35
00:02:03.613 --> 00:02:07.455
"Aww! He's so cute!"

36
00:02:07.475 --> 00:02:12.239
"Yes, he's very cute," Detective Smith said.

37
00:02:12.259 --> 00:02:14.460
"But we still have a mystery to solve."

38
00:02:15.961 --> 00:02:18.823
"Right!" Roxy looked around the office.

39
00:02:19.724 --> 00:02:20.664
There wasn't much in it.

40
00:02:21.605 --> 00:02:25.508
It had a desk, a chair, a shelf with binders, and a small safe.

41
00:02:25.528 --> 00:02:28.410
"Did anyone see Mr.

42
00:02:28.470 --> 00:02:29.290
Copper leave?"

43
00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:32.884
"I don't think so," Detective Smith said.

44
00:02:32.904 --> 00:02:35.366
"There was no one else here when I arrived."

45
00:02:39.427 --> 00:02:42.589
Just then the office door flew open, and a woman stepped in.

46
00:02:42.609 --> 00:02:46.610
"What's going on in here?"

47
00:02:46.630 --> 00:02:50.472
"Mr. Copper disappeared," Detective Smith said.

48
00:02:50.492 --> 00:02:52.113
"Do you know him?"

49
00:02:53.313 --> 00:02:54.554
The woman folded her arms.

50
00:02:54.574 --> 00:02:56.514
"Of course I do.

51
00:02:56.995 --> 00:02:58.175
He's my father.

52
00:02:58.895 --> 00:02:59.836
He went on vacation.

53
00:03:00.628 --> 00:03:02.309
Now can you please leave?

54
00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:04.790
I have important work to do."

55
00:03:08.712 --> 00:03:10.634
Roxy and Detective Smith went outside.

56
00:03:13.315 --> 00:03:14.676
Right away Roxy gasped.

57
00:03:15.696 --> 00:03:17.417
Babies crawled along the sidewalk.

58
00:03:17.437 --> 00:03:20.559
"Where did my husband go?"

59
00:03:21.039 --> 00:03:21.800
a woman shouted.

60
00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:25.962
"And why is that baby wearing his tie?"

61
00:03:25.982 --> 00:03:29.564
"People are turning into babies!"

62
00:03:30.112 --> 00:03:31.092
Detective Smith said.

63
00:03:31.112 --> 00:03:35.533
"Ba-ba-ba!" The baby in his arms sang and drooled.

64
00:03:37.474 --> 00:03:38.514
Roxy gasped again.

65
00:03:38.534 --> 00:03:41.335
"This baby looks just like Mr.

66
00:03:41.395 --> 00:03:44.296
Copper. I think it is him!"

67
00:03:44.316 --> 00:03:47.357
"What about that woman in the office?"

68
00:03:47.817 --> 00:03:48.897
Detective Smith asked.

69
00:03:48.917 --> 00:03:50.978
"Was it really Mr.

70
00:03:51.038 --> 00:03:51.938
Copper's daughter?"

71
00:03:54.799 --> 00:03:56.319
Roxy rushed back into the office.

72
00:03:57.179 --> 00:03:59.720
The woman was gone, and the safe was empty!
